                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Extract from minutes of board, May 29, 1866, that
                        extended lease for one year more.</hi></head>
                <p>The governor and deputy governor reported that the lease of the Russian-American
                    territory had been renewed for one year more at the former terms—which was
                    approved.</p>
